1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,560
Masuk lift, sinyal langsung ambruk.

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:06,702
Padahal BTS-nya tidak ke mana-mana.

3
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:09,058
Sinyal HP adalah gelombang radio.

4
00:00:09,243 --> 00:00:10,811
Ia bisa menembus dinding,

5
00:00:10,831 --> 00:00:13,453
tapi setiap lapisan membuatnya melemah.

6
00:00:13,953 --> 00:00:16,370
Beton bertulang meredam sinyal cukup

7
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,788
kuat, dan makin tinggi frekuensinya,

8
00:00:18,808 --> 00:00:20,073
redamannya makin besar.

9
00:00:20,243 --> 00:00:22,273
Kaca biasa hampir tidak mengganggu,

10
00:00:22,293 --> 00:00:24,177
tapi kaca hemat energi berlapis logam

11
00:00:24,197 --> 00:00:26,123
bisa memangkas sinyal ratusan kali lipat.

12
00:00:26,293 --> 00:00:27,793
Lift lebih parah lagi:

13
00:00:27,872 --> 00:00:30,112
kotak logam yang mengurung HP-mu.

14
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:33,633
Di basement, sinyal dari luar bisa

15
00:00:33,653 --> 00:00:35,568
jatuh sampai setara derau.

16
00:00:36,062 --> 00:00:38,756
Jadi bukan HP-mu yang rusak,

17
00:00:38,776 --> 00:00:40,365
sinyalnya habis di perjalanan.

18
00:00:40,865 --> 00:00:42,775
Solusinya membawa sinyal ke dalam.

19
00:00:42,945 --> 00:00:44,872
Gedung besar memasang antena kecil

20
00:00:44,892 --> 00:00:46,729
di plafon yang tersambung ke operator,

21
00:00:46,749 --> 00:00:48,705
disebut in-building system.

22
00:00:48,875 --> 00:00:51,023
Ada juga small cell,

23
00:00:51,043 --> 00:00:52,565
dan panggilan lewat Wi-Fi.

24
00:00:53,065 --> 00:00:54,143
Jadi sinyal tidak hilang,

25
00:00:54,163 --> 00:00:55,445
ia tertahan dinding.

26
00:00:55,615 --> 00:00:57,541
Di gedung mana sinyalmu paling sering hilang?

27
00:00:58,070 --> 00:00:59,969
Ini AUDIRA Explained.
